INT. FLOWER WHOLESALER COLD ROOM - PRE-DAWN

Buckets of roses. Fog from the compressor. A caged bulb.

Three people in refrigerated coats stand around a steel table. A blueprint under their elbows. A thermos steaming.

PHILOMENA "PHIL" ADEWALE-STRAND (50s, reading glasses) taps the blueprint with a pencil.

RAFAEL "RAFI" KOWALCZYK-MENSAH (30s, tattooed forearm) stirs coffee with a pen.

DESIREE "DESI" LINDGREN-OKAFOR (20s, headphones round neck) chews a rose petal.

PHIL
The armored van arrives at six.

RAFI
Six-ten.

DESI
Six-oh-five.

PHIL
Six.

RAFI
It's always late.

DESI
Not on Thursdays.

PHIL
It's Thursday.

RAFI
It's a flower truck on Thursdays.

DESI
They deliver the same floor.

PHIL
They deliver at the same dock.

RAFI
Different dock.

DESI
Same dock, different door.

PHIL
Children.

They stop. Rafi sips. Desi shrugs.

PHIL (CONT'D)
Same dock. Same door. We hide in the roses.

RAFI
In the roses.

DESI
Thorns?

PHIL
Dethorned.

DESI
Oh.

RAFI
Desi.

DESI ^
Rafi.

They say each other's name together. Rafi grins. Desi flicks the petal at him. It lands on the blueprint.

PHIL
(to the room)
Five-forty. Positions.

She folds the blueprint. Slides it into her coat. Rafi screws the lid on the thermos. Desi pulls her headphones up.

The compressor shudders. The light flickers once, then steadies.
